{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your shipping logistics empire. <br>Flip the first tile.<br>Flip the next tile.<br>Keep going.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/port-shipping-tycoon.gif?t=1745915374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That tree you just unlocked? It's producing wood.\u00a0<br>Wood gets sent to the port.<br>Port unlocks a new ship.<br>Ship sails to the next port, carrying wood.<br><br>A new factory just opened! <br>Factory prints microchips. <br>Microchips get sent to the port. <br>Ship takes microchip to the next port.<br><br>Three upgrade choices: Quantity of shipments, Active Income or Offline Income.<br>Should you maximize on one path, or average out? <br>Decisions.<br>While you're thinking, keep on flipping.<br> <br>Tiles and more tiles.  <br>Does this ever end?  <br>15 huge maps in this game.  <br>Spend over 10 hours flipping tiles.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572770?t=1745915374","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572770?t=1745915374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/c2057408ea7ecf00a78b4eacdf0850c4f5632bff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745915374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/c2057408ea7ecf00a78b4eacdf0850c4f5632bff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745915374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3650530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your shipping logistics empire. <br>Flip the first tile.<br>Flip the next tile.<br>Keep going.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/port-shipping-tycoon.gif?t=1745915374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That tree you just unlocked? It's producing wood.\u00a0<br>Wood gets sent to the port.<br>Port unlocks a new ship.<br>Ship sails to the next port, carrying wood.<br><br>A new factory just opened! <br>Factory prints microchips. <br>Microchips get sent to the port. <br>Ship takes microchip to the next port.<br><br>Three upgrade choices: Quantity of shipments, Active Income or Offline Income.<br>Should you maximize on one path, or average out? <br>Decisions.<br>While you're thinking, keep on flipping.<br> <br>Tiles and more tiles.  <br>Does this ever end?  <br>15 huge maps in this game.  <br>Spend over 10 hours flipping tiles.  </p>","developers":["Urban Isotope"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/d71bdf13840da9c3aea4447c3ee3e1465106aa08/header.jpg?t=1745915374","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14.6.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123056,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123056/movie480.mp4?t=1745915373","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123056/movie_max.mp4?t=1745915373"},"name":"Port Shipping Tycoon Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123056/01b38c1